   "No price appears in a draft unless it came out of a message we watched leave the building. Five of the drafts below name a figure; every one of those figures is from estimating@'s sent items. The AdminBase rows are quoted from the CRM, and the CRM has already been shown to disagree with reality, so those drafts ask what happened rather than assert a number.",
