    "now": "April was GBP 4,252.16 for six uPVC windows over both floors. July is GBP 7,975.85 for four aluminium windows and a door on the ground floor. Two different scopes, and we lost the first one.",
    "why": "The April figure was read off AdminBase lead 8155, and AdminBase updates the VALUE on a re-quote while leaving the dates and the lead number alone. The row was April's enquiry wearing July's price - which is why it matched 'to the penny'. Mary has both quote files; the CRM has one row.",
